Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 02:04:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] board: samsung: Add Galaxy A5 (2017) a5y17lte on Exynos
 7880 (step 1 diagnostics)

Adds Exynos 7880 SoC support and the a5y17lte board with a diagnostics
mode that prints CPU, timer, DECON and IDMA state to the boot
framebuffer at 0x67000000 and halts. First step of an XNU port.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PCgURnyLYz6KYCEcLn4Tp2
